{
  "_about": [
    "Pre-loaded statement wording -> field, from the statement formats seen so far.",
    "Matching normalises quarters, years, dates and gain/loss wording, so 'Called in Q1, 2026'",
    "also matches 'Called in Q3, 2027' and 'Capital Loss' also matches 'Capital Gain'.",
    "'section' (optional) is the heading the line sits under; it separates lines that read the",
    "same in different blocks (realised vs unrealised). metric 'ignore' = a known line that is",
    "not a value for the quarter. Reviewers add their own terms in the app; confirmed values",
    "teach the app each fund's wording automatically. No figures belong in this file."
  ],
